window.products.push({"id":508038,"name":"10 inch Bread Proofing Basket, Banneton Bread Making Kit Round Sourdough Bowl with Scraper + Liner Cloth for Professional & Home Bakers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ehoZlrkSL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"honsundy Bread Proofing Basket, 9 inch Banneton Bread Proofing Basket Round Dough Proofing Bowl with Liner Banneton Proofing Basket High-quality Banneton Proofing Basket We are a professional at banneton proofing baskets. Made of the highest quality Indonesian imported natural rattan, non-toxic and tasteless, safe and harmless,tough texture,light and convenient.The proofing basket help the loaves keep their shape and structure through their final rise. Proofing baskets aren't just relegated to the realm of professional baking. They are readily available to home Handmade and a cinch to use. Purpose of using Banneton Proofing Basket When the dough'surface has too much water, the dough cannot be molded without a proofing basket.After the dough is finally fermented, the proofing basket is used to shape, and the banneton proofing basket is the best additional support to shape,the dough after fermentation also will have the unique texture pattern of the proofing basket. In addition, this proofing basket is very lightweight and easy to use. If you like to make bread with chewy and beautiful appearance, our proofing basket is your best choice. How to use Banneton Proofing Basket for the First Time For the proofing basket with cloth liner, before using it for the first time, spray the surface of the rattan basket with a watering can, and then evenly spread a layer of dry flour on the surface of basket, shake off the excess flour, place the dough in the brotss basket to ferment,after enough fermented then gently transfer it from the basket to oven for baking.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ehoZlrkSL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"honsundy","source_asin":"B089W6YDL5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-508038","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089W6YDL5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089W6YDL5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
