window.products.push({"id":508102,"name":"Hallmark Keepsake Christmas 2019 Year Dated Wars Imperial Star Destroyer Ornament with Light and Sound","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YA2L-RcNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A symbol of the Galactic Empire's might, Star Destroyers punctuated the Imperial starfleet with their imposing size and formidable capabilities. None was more menacing than the Devastator—Darth Vader's Star Destroyer—which captured the Tantive IV, Princess Leia's rebel blockade runner. This Christmas tree ornament features the intimidating Star Destroyer with the Tantive IV dangling from its hull. Plug it into Hallmark's Keepsake Power Cord (sold separately) for constant illumination, then press the button to start an epic sound and light show scene from Star Wars: A New Hope. Connect all of the Star Wars Storytellers ornaments—Darth Vader’s TIE Fighter, X-Wing Starfighter, Death Star, TIE Fighter, the Millennium Falcon, Imperial Star Destroyer and Y-Wing Starfighter, each sold separately—to unlock additional amazing interactive performances. No batteries necessary. Storytellers Interactive Light and Sound Christmas tree ornament. Connect this ornament to Hallmark's Keepsake Power Cord to see the continuous light effect. Press the button to watch it perform an exciting sound and light show scene from Star Wars: A New Hope. Requires Hallmark's Keepsake Power Cord, sold separately. Artist crafted by Robert Hurlburt, this Christmas tree ornament comes pre-packaged in a box for easy gift giving, preservation and storage. Dated 2019 in copyright. Add additional Star Wars Storytellers ornaments (each sold separately) to unlock larger, amazingly interactive performances. With unparalleled artistry and exceptional detail, each festive and collectible Keepsake Ornament is made for years of celebrations. From preserving precious memories to commemorating special milestones and interests, there's a Hallmark ornament for everyone on your gift list. Hallmark has been your family-owned creator of greeting cards, gifts, gift wrap and more for over 100 years. We take deep pride in helping individuals connect in just the right way. Plastic Christmas tree ornament is lead-free and measures 3.72\" W x 1.74\" H x 6.7\" D.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YA2L-RcNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hallmark Keepsake","source_asin":"B0819123KV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-508102","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0819123KV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0819123KV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
