window.products.push({"id":508240,"name":"Inflatable Travel Neck Pillow with Storage Bag for Traveling Office or Home Using Automatic Inflation/Deflation Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81u-Xi2uIqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Traveling Has Never Been More Comfortable! Do you always fall asleep when you travel and always wake up with sore nape muscles and back pain? This will never happen again once you buy this inflatable travel neck pillow! When inflated, the ergonomic travel pillow will provide your neck and lumbar with great support, so that you can be comfortable through out the trip. The inflatable travel pillow becomes very small when deflated, so you can easily fit it into its storage back and take it with you anywhere you go. You Won’t Be Out Of Breath When Inflating The Neck Pillow! And why would you? To inflate the travel pillow all you have to do is press the inflation valve about 40 times with your finger –and it’s ready! When it’s time to deflate the travel air pillow, simply remove the valve lid and press the valve with your finger until all the air is out. That’s easy, right? Designed To Last A Lifetime! Made with premium PVC material and a strong valve, the inflatable neck pillow can with stand high pressure without any problems. The odorless PVC material is also 100% nontoxic, so this durable travel neck pillow is absolutely safe for you and your loved ones. You Can Wash The Cover Whenever You Want! Did the soft cotton cover of the air pillow get dirty? Then find the invisible zipper and remove it from the elastic PVC tank. You can then wash it and put it over the neck pillow again –trust us, it will only take a few seconds! So What Are You Waiting For? AAKULU’s travel neck pillow is under a 30-day money back guarantee and a 1-year replacement warranty, so there’s no reason to hold back! Scroll Up And Click “Add to Cart” NOW!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81u-Xi2uIqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AAKULU","source_asin":"B07GSVKR6Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-508240","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GSVKR6Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GSVKR6Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
