window.products.push({"id":508386,"name":"Bella Taylor Home, Primitive Country, Star Patch Red Quilted Bedding, 5 Piece Quilt Set, Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":229.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713NKBd6lkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SIMPLE COUNTRY CHARM with six coordinating rustic country red, tan, and black plaid and checked fabrics in a traditional star and ninepatch patchwork quilt. HAND-QUILTED PATCHWORK in 100% cotton throughout. Machine pieced with stitch in the ditch and echo hand quilting. 5 PIECE SET includes (1) queen quilt 90 x 90 in., (2) standard 21 x 27 in. shams, (1) queen bed skirt 60 x 80 x 16 in., and (1) 16 x 16 in. fabric pillow cover (filler pillow not included). FEATURES: A midweight quilt with breathable 100% cotton fill, designed for year-round use. CARE: Machine wash separately, front load commercial washer recommended. Cold water, gentle cycle, no chlorine bleach. Line dry. Do not dry clean or use commercial cleaning chemicals.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713NKBd6lkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bella Taylor Home","source_asin":"B09MSTF2HK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-508386","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MSTF2HK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MSTF2HK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":508387,"name":"SINARDO Wire Storage Basket Organizer Bin Baskets for Kithen Cabinets Freezer Bedroom Bathroom (3, Rose Gold)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71x8R6aDKSL._AC_SL1420_.jpg","description":"Large Size:28*22*12cm(11*8.6*4.7 Inches) ,weight:364g/pc  SINARDO Organizer Baskets Trays make it simple and easy to store and organize everything from dry food items, snacks and canned goods to arts and crafts, cleaning products, health and beauty items and more! Built-in handles make it easy to transport from shelf to table to counter. The versatile design works with any decor. mDesign - more calm, less clutter","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71x8R6aDKSL._AC_SL1420_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SOWTECH","source_asin":"B07JXS21CB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-508387","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JXS21CB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JXS21CB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":508388,"name":"Manual Inspirational Collection 26 X 36-Inch Wall Hanging and Finial Rod, Direct Thy Paths with Verse","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.09,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91++lljsqUL._AC_SL1462_.jpg","description":"Manual Woodworkers and Weavers brings you a fresh way to display your favorite images and showcase inspiring message with their collection of hanging wall art with included finial hanging rod. Although Thomas Lemuel Oates started Manual Woodworkers and Weavers in 1932, the story goes back further. The roots of the company can be found in Oates' entrepreneurial spirit. He and his brother used to farm the mountain areas of Bat Cave in western North Carolina. They would also help their mother find materials for her crafts. The sons began to make wooden whistles, buckets and bird-houses. They would sell their wares along with her crafts to the people from Charlotte that came through in their horse-drawn buggies on the way to the mountains. Later, Thomas worked at the Ashville Postcard Company. When the Depression hit, he lost his job, but it inspired him to go into business and sell crafts, like cornhusk dolls and woven pieces, that were produced by the local women. He had learned about the wholesale business while working at Ashville. He built a waterwheel to generate electricity at a mill, began making product and opened shop. Over the years, he expanded the company. His son, Lemuel Oates, who would next manage the company, says he worked in the business from a young age. He explains the products were made from cotton scraps left over from making socks. Half-inch circles would be looped together to form a variety of products. Lemuel Oates went to college and then settled in Richmond. In December 1973, he returned to Bat Cave and took over the company. In 2007 his son Travis and his daughter, Molly Oates Sherrill, took over the business.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91++lljsqUL._AC_SL1462_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Manual Woodworker","source_asin":"B003RL7YMG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-508388","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003RL7YMG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003RL7YMG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":508389,"name":"Hide & Drink, Rustic Leather Pint Sleeve with Handle, Bar Pub Style Handmade (Bourbon Brown)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gSK4x0GmL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"DECORATIVE AND FUNCTIONAL LEATHER PINT SLEEVE: This attractive, handcrafted and hand sewn Leather Pint Sleeve with Handle is the only way to drink your cold beer. Fits any standard 16oz pint glass and the sturdy leather handle allows you to sip away at your favorite beverage with your pinkie raised up high HANDMADE FROM ATTRACTIVE FULL GRAIN LEATHER: The Pint Sleeve is carefully handcrafted and diligently hand sewn using the highest quality leather you can find, namely Full Grain Leather. The leather handle is attached using heavy duty brass metal rivets, ensuring durability and a lifetime of use PROVIDES EXCELLENT INSULATION, WHILE IMPROVING WITH AGE & USAGE: The beauty of Full Grain Leather is that it offers a natural lining of insulation, maintaining the temperature of your beverage, be it hot or cold. Also, the leather keeps your hand dry from any condensation on the glass, or from high temperatures from hot drinks. The high quality, Full Grain Leather will assume a beautiful and eye-catching patina over time and after frequent use. MAKES A GREAT GIFT: This is a great gift for your friends and loved ones who enjoy a good pint. If you’re a regular at a bar, or you have a bar at home, then this makes a fantastic addition. The Leather Pint Sleeve would be a great gift for a housewarming party, or the perfect Father’s Day gift, too","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gSK4x0GmL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hide & Drink","source_asin":"B0BJYBDSLL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-508389","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJYBDSLL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJYBDSLL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
