window.products.push({"id":508530,"name":"Back40Life - Precision Cut Wood Brush Calligraphy Script Monogram Letter - B Large","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pIp7rT8wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A beautiful wooden brush calligraphy script style monogram letter cutout. Letter is precision cut out of 1/2\" thick birch plywood for crisp, clean details and will be sanded ready for you to finish. An easy DIY project or gift!. . . . . . . . FINISHING . . . . . . . . Each monogram is individually cut, sanded, and ready for finishing. Some minor prep sanding may be required. Finish with your favorite paint or stain color. We recommend applying a clear protective coat to make the color and wood grain come alive!. . . . . . . . HANGING . . . . . . . .No hardware is necessary. You can simply insert a small finish nail on your wall and hang the letter directly on the nail. Try using ribbon or twine to suspend the letter for a different look. You can also use double-stick tape or command strips to secure the letter to any surface.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pIp7rT8wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Back40Life","source_asin":"B07VCMN3RY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-508530","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VCMN3RY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VCMN3RY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
