window.products.push({"id":508566,"name":"Veitch fairytales Kids Cooking Baking Set for Girls, Real Baking Supplies Kits, Birthday Gifts for 3 + Year Old Girls, Kids Baking Utensils Includes R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LtzKPER+S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍪【 Super Luxurious Pink themed Baking 38 Pcs Set 】— Animal-shaped cookie cutters can make cute cookies. With muffin cups, scrapers and decorating supplies, kid can make cakes in different shapes. The egg separator and whisk can easily prepare to bake ingredients. Rolling pin and scraper can easily handle dough shapes. A high-quality suitcase can take in all the tools. This is the all-round baking set that children dream of. 🍪【 Suitable For Different Ages And Machine Washable 】— The apron has enough straps to tie around the neck and waist to suit children of different ages. There is an elastic band of the back of the chef’s hat to fit the child’s head. Edge reinforcement, comfortable to wear, machine washable. Pass the safety tests of CPC, CPSIA and ASTM standards. 🍪【 Teach Through Lively Activities 】— Role playing is one of children's favorite games. They like to pretend they are doing 'grown-up' things - It is a fun and important part of childhood development. Give children a chance of role plays as a chef and teach the knowledge of baking. This chef costume for kids will give your children a novel experience of becoming a real little chef and stimulate their interest in cooking. 🍪【 Sweet Family Time 】— Through interactive early learning, the kids baking chef set helps you teach your kids how to bake and brings you some wonderful family time. Children will wear this chef costume to learn to bake techniques from their parents. It helps to accompany the growth of children and create more lasting sweet memories. 🍪【 Wonderful Gift 】— This is a perfect holiday gift. Baking supplies inspires children to play the role of chefs, improve their sense of responsibility and project management skills. The children used cookie molds with different contours to make creative graphics and cakes. It allows children's imagination to be freely used. The girls like the pink theme. It is recommended as a birthday or holiday gift for children over 3 years old.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LtzKPER+S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Veitch fairytales","source_asin":"B0B1GZKFF1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-508566","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1GZKFF1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1GZKFF1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
