window.products.push({"id":508596,"name":"Cali King Size 10 PC Luxury Bed Sheet Bundle - Extra Soft Breathable, Cooling Bed Sheets w/ Deep Pockets & Wrinkle Free Finish - Easy Fit Comfy Bed Bu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":72.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719ourzDiyL._AC_SL1435_.jpg","description":"CGK Unlimited 10-Piece Cali King Size Sheet Set with Deep Pockets Many Cali King sheet set's are made of cheap, low-quality bedding fabric that tears easily and feels rough and uncomfortable against the skin. Our CGK Unlimited Cali King size fitted sheet & flat sheet set uses super-fine, double brushed microfiber fabric which has some commenting that our Cali King sheets luxury bedding feel softer than 1,000, 1500, and 1800 thread count sheets. Our tightly woven 10-piece sheet bundle set guarantees softness coupled with extra strength and durability. Plus, lightweight & breathable. CGK Unlimited’s 10-Piece Sheet Bundle Includes: 2 Flat Sheets (108” x 102”) 2 Fitted Sheets (84” x 72”) 6 Cooling, Silky Pillowcases (40” x 20”) Perfect Fit While many deep pocket sheets Cali King are ill-fitting and can be a struggle to get on the bed, our Cali King fitted sheets have deep pockets to easily fit mattresses up to 16 inches, so making the Cali King bed takes half the time. Fits comfortably over mattress toppers and air mattresses, too! Features: Deep Pockets to Fit Mattresses 16” Deep Premium 100% Brushed Microfiber Fabric Luxuriously, Buttery Soft Breathable & Cooling Machine Washable & Stain-Resistant for Easy Cleaning Resistant to Tearing, Shrinking &Fading! At CGK Unlimited, we love giving our customers the gift of deep, luxurious sleep – at an affordable price. We have high standards for our bed sheet set, and work hard to uphold those standards and keep you happy and well-rested. Our hotel quality, ultra soft sheet set Cali King will leave you sleeping deeply.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719ourzDiyL._AC_SL1435_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CGK Unlimited","source_asin":"B09P17GPGD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-508596","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09P17GPGD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09P17GPGD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":508597,"name":"Frywall 10 (Medium) - Green - Splatter Guard, as Seen on Shark Tank","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LolxEXlrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Frywall keeps your stovetop spotless no matter the meal, providing better protection than splatter screens while keeping your pan completely accessible throughout the cooking process. You can fry, simmer, or sauté as you would with an uncovered pan, and still keep your stovetop spotless. It’s perfect for deep fried delicacies like fried chicken and latkes, as well as for pan-fried burgers and steaks, bacon, bubbling tomato sauce, or that huge pile of greens that always tumbles onto the stovetop. Frywall is dishwasher safe and rolls up into a compact sleeve for storage. Made of BPA-free, FDA-compliant high temperature silicone rated to 450°F. Pan not included. U.S. Patent No. 9,784,302. Other patent applications are pending.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LolxEXlrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Frywall","source_asin":"B0773H8TF7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-508597","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0773H8TF7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0773H8TF7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
