window.products.push({"id":508793,"name":"Bonsenkitchen Food Sealer Machine, Dry/Moist Vacuum Sealer Machine with 5-in-1 Easy Options for Sous Vide and Food Storage, Air Sealer Machine with 5 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wPLIm0i3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PROFESSIONAL VACUUM SEALER: The Bonsenkitchen food sealer machine only takes 10-12 seconds to complete the food vacuum sealing. Vacuum sealer for food is easy to operate with 5 buttons. It is a great solution to keep food fresher for longer. It can keep food fresh for 8 times longer than normal storage methods. WET/DRY DUAL MODE: Meal vacuum sealer machine's newly upgraded wet pumping function can help preserve cured meat and seafood for up to 25 days and lock in moisture, save money and waste less. While the dry pumping mode can meet the daily meal preparation needs of nuts, snacks, fruits, vegetables, etc. EXTERNAL VACUUM SYSTEM: For crisper jars and crisper boxes, the vacuum packaging machine can reduce the rate of food oxidation and prevent the smell of wine and sauces from evaporating too quickly. Air sealer machine can also protect your valuables, keeping them isolated from air and moisture. 【BPA FREE】Bonsenkitchen vacuum food sealer roll bags can be microwaved, frozen, re-used, washed, boiled and dishwasher safe. Allows you to precisely control your cooking temperature to achieve perfect results. You can cook sous vide in Bonsenkitchen bags by placing them in water at any temperature up to 230°F/110°C 【HEAVY DUTY COMMERCIAL GRADE Vacuum Sealer】Bonsenkitchen food vaccum bags have specially designed channels that remove oxygen, keeping your food's moisture and creating an airtight barrier that locks in flavor and prevents spoilage and freezer burn","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wPLIm0i3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bonsenkitchen","source_asin":"B0BTHVDV7V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-508793","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTHVDV7V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTHVDV7V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":508794,"name":"FOOXYEEL Heat Resistant Placemat for Kids, Cute Bear Non Slip Silicone Placemat Reusable Washable Table Mat for Baby Toddlers (Pink) FKP003 18*11*0.08","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Zt9P2uQOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About UsFOOXYEEL is committed to providing consumers with superior and durable table mats, including silicone placemats, kids' placemats, coasters. Our placemats are not only desktop protection tools but also elegant home decorations. Our products integrate art into your life through simple and smooth line design.Why Choose Our Silicone Placemat for Kids?※ Raised edge※ Easy to clean※ Sturdy & durable※ Lovely & cute bear※ Fresh colors for kids※ Safe and soft silicone※ Excellent heat resistanceDesigned for ChildrenAn exclusive non-slip placemat helps attract children's attention to meals, cultivate their independent eating habits, and make eating more enjoyable.Heat ResistantThe thickened placemat has an excellent heat-insulating effect, which can withstand a high temperature of up to 446°F, protecting the desktop from scalding.Widely UsedThe washable placemat can be rolled up and folded to store and carry out—ideal for dinner, breakfast, pasta, salad with various bowls and cups.Ideal GiftThe cute bear mat with excellent heat resistance is an ideal gift for birthdays, Christmas, and anniversaries. Your child or friend will love it!After-Sales ServiceFor this table mat, you will get 100% customer support. If you have any questions about heat-resistant placemats, please feel free to contact us.Tips1. Colors may appear slightly different via the website due to computer picture resolution and monitor settings.2. There is a 2-3% difference according to manual measurement.3. Please do not use sharp objects to damage the placemat.4. Please do not expose the placemat to open flames.SpecificationsMaterial...100% Food-Grade SiliconeColor...PinkSize...18*11*0.08 inchesWeight...8.8 ozHeat resistance...-40 to 446℉Package Contents1 * Table placemat","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Zt9P2uQOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FOOXYEEL","source_asin":"B09CKGQFKN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-508794","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CKGQFKN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CKGQFKN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":508795,"name":"Martex Vellux King Blanket, Buttercup","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SRCC0WS2L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description A truly remarkable blanket with a unique velvety texture, Vellux provides warm yet lightweight comfort, will not mat or pill and washed beautifully. In fact, the more you wash it, the softer it gets. No wonder it is featured in many of America's finest hotels. It's the durable blanket that lasts a lifetime. The Martex Velluxe is America's best selling blanket. It's the top choice for parents with children and the top choice for hotels nation-wide. Velvety and luxurious. Hypo-allergenic. Very durable, withstands frequent washings. Will not fade, pill, stretch, or matt. The perfect year-round blanket because it's lightweight but warm. Offered in a broad assortment of colors. Amazon.com This dreamily soft blanket from Martex feels just like velvet, but is remarkably lightweight and easy to maintain. It is made with millions of nylon surface fibers and two layers of insulating polyurethane foam for maximum warmth and comfort. The plush surface wont mat or pill no matter how many times the blanket is washed. Plus, it wont fade or lose its velvety softness. This blanket is used in many hotels around the world because its hypoallergenic and withstands frequent washings. Because its breathable and lightweight, its perfect for use in all seasons. Since its available in a range of stylish colors, it will compliment any décor. This blanket would add a special touch of luxury to your guest bed, but once you experience its softness, youll probably want one for your own bed, as well. --Susannah Detlef","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SRCC0WS2L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Martex","source_asin":"B0000BY8RV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-508795","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000BY8RV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000BY8RV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
