window.products.push({"id":508816,"name":"Qualsen Window Films Bamboo Static Decorative Privacy Window Films for Glass Non-Adhesive Anti Uv Window Sticker for Home Kitchen Bedroom Living Room ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KkPjlWZaL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"NO ADHESIVE & EASY INSTALLATION : Glue Free Design. Applies in minutes, easy to fix with water (soap water would be better), make your window looks awesome. (Please do remember to peel off the backing film before installing the privacy film. Otherwise, the film will fall off when the water is dry) PRIVACY PROTECTION : This privacy window film can Instantly change your see-through glass into a 3D Bamboo frosted glass panels. Privacy Level :★★★☆☆ Private Window Films (Mild privacy, not recommended for bathroom), The film itself is No Color, Colorful Principle is the principle of light reflection and refraction. WASHABLE & REUSABLE: This window protection sticker is Waterproof, oil-resistant. Long useful life, easy to position and remove without any residue. So it can be reused if not damaged or smudged. WIDELY APPLICATION: Suitable for smooth and clean glass surfaces in the living room, bedroom, kitchen, office, meeting room, hotel and etc. (Please Make sure window surface is completely clean and absolutely free of any blemishes, and tear off the outside protection film before you post the privacy window film on the smooth surface. ) PACKAGE INCLUDE : 1 roll of window film; 1 piece of instruction; 1 piece of professional stainless steel film cutter; 1 piece of stainless steel ruler; 1 piece of cleaning cloth. Easy to cut into any size to meet your special demands.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KkPjlWZaL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Qualsen","source_asin":"B07CTKK5SL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-508816","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CTKK5SL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CTKK5SL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
