window.products.push({"id":508870,"name":"Purple Heart Urn - Mini Heart Keepsake Urn with Stand & Box - Small Purple Urn for Human Ashes - Honor Your Loved One with Cremation Urn Heart Shaped ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614N4UUG-iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BEAUTIFUL PURPLE HEART KEEPSAKE URN: Give your cherished one the love they deserve. Our purple heart urn has been handmade with love and care. The elegant purple urn heart is a classic design that will never go out of style. The heart is a symbol of timeless love and is a versatile design that can be used by anyone. It can hold up to 3 cubic inches of ash. This beautiful small heart keepsake urn will honor your loved one forever. HANDCRAFTED MINI URN FOR ASHES: Our durable and rustproof heart urns are made with the highest quality brass. It is handcrafted to perfection by skilled artisans, and you're sure to get the best standard. All mini heart urns are made by hand; small imperfections/differences can happen and are part of the quality of a handmade product. This is what makes our ash urns unique and special. INCLUDES HEART URN STAND AND VELVET BOX: This premium purple keepsake urn comes with a durable heart urn stand and a velvet box. This beautiful box is perfect for carrying and storing the heart cremation urn. This small heart shaped urn is approx. 2.9 inches high & 3 inches wide. HIGH QUALITY & DURABLE SMALL URN: This beautiful purple urn heart shaped is solid and made of high-quality brass. The pleasing ash urn keepsake design is handmade by highly skilled craftsmen using traditional time-honored techniques. You can be rest assured that this mini heart urn with stand will last generations. PEACE OF MIND WITH OUR 30-DAY RETURN POLICY: Our goal is to provide you with the top-quality mini urn purple for your loved one, that will meet or exceed your expectations. In any case that we fall short of that goal, you can return the small heart urn for human ashes purple within 30 days after delivery for a prompt replacement or refund. No restocking charges, no hassle!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614N4UUG-iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Solace Forever","source_asin":"B08QD8NBML","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-508870","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QD8NBML","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QD8NBML","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
