window.products.push({"id":508876,"name":"Ras Décor Linen Sheets for Motorhomes & Camper Beds,RV Sheets 72x75 Short King,Fit up to 10 Inch Deep Brushed Microfiber Sheets, Ivory - 4 Piece Sheet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61q1HfPzOgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RV & Camper owners LOVE these sheets - they fit and feel GREAT! With so many RV's on the roads these days, it's no wonder that our Sheet Sets, made specifically to fit Campers, RV's and Travel Trailers have been such a huge hit! RV Sheets from Ras Decor Linen We make them specifically to fit the mattress sizes found in Travel Trailers, Motorhomes, RV's & Campers! Road Ready Sheet Sets are made of a soft 400 thread count 100% cotton. We use a superior quality fabric which gives you a softer sheet that is also durable. The fitted sheet has strong, 1/2\" elastic sewn completely around the bottom to ensure a snug fit. Bunks will fit a mattress up to 10\" thick, Packaged in a zippered vinyl bag - appropriate for gift-giving! There are several things you should know before purchasing sheet sets for your Camper or RV. MOST beds in campers and RV's are not a \"normal bed size.\" Meaning, you probably won't find sheets at the local discount store that will fit properly.While there are some bed sizes found in RV's that are more common than others, there are several different sizes depending on the manufacturer. We have listed the \"most common\" sizes for you below, but before ordering, it is important that you measure the width, length and depth of your mattress to ensure a proper fit. For Customization: Contact us for customize your RV Mattress sheets for any size, any shape, any color, any pattern and any deep pocket. Don’t wait. Order your own 100% Cotton Luxury Hotel Collection 400TC Cotton Bed Sheets NOW!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61q1HfPzOgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ras Decor Linen","source_asin":"B07MQ5XSJ7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-508876","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MQ5XSJ7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MQ5XSJ7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
