window.products.push({"id":508880,"name":"Milk Frother, Basecent Electric Milk Frother Handheld Milk Foamer For Coffee, Latte, Cappuccino, Matcha, Frappe/Automatic Stainless Steel Mini Drink M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ePFyayM7L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"[Enjoy Delicious Cream in Seconds] The handheld milk frother / coffee mixer will bring you creamy milk foam and coffee for all day. It can froth your milk in 12 seconds or less (Test in an ideal environment), and it is a perfect foam mixer frother for coffee, latte, cappuccino, matcha, hot chocolate and milk. This coffee mixer also works well with both hot and frappe cold drinks. [Easy to Use & Clean] The one-press button (no need to hold on the button) on the top is easy to use. After heating the milk, put the milk frother into the pitcher, within seconds you will lather enough froth and foam with this milk frother electric handheld. It is super easy to clean, just take off the whisk and put it into the dishwasher or wash it in soapy or clean water. [Powerful & Professional Design] The mini mixer handheld milk frother’s motor is powered by 3 AAA batteries which is more powerful than other handheld milk frothers. This is also a professional drink mixer for your personal party and camping, and even for a professional bartender. Our handheld milk frother will let you have a fantastic and fabulous experience. [Food-Grade Materials] Compare to other plastic coffee mixer, this electric mixer handheld has a food-grade 304 stainless steel whisk and body. The inside of the body is made of ABS plastic which is stronger than normal plastic, which will also extend the service life of this coffee mixer. Never rust, never break. [Satisfaction Guarantee] We guarantee that we will offer you the service with 100% satisfaction, and you will enjoy this milk frother handheld coffee frother with delicious and creamy milk. We offer lifetime guarantee and 30-day full money refund to this latte / cappuccino frother.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ePFyayM7L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BASECENT","source_asin":"B07PTZKSPQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-508880","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PTZKSPQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PTZKSPQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":508881,"name":"Primitives by Kathy OMG LOL Dish Towel, 28\" x 28\", Best Aunt Ever","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.83,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Gxc3mDUkL._AC_.jpg","description":"Sturdy dish towel reads: Best Aunt Ever. Made from strong, high quality cotton for softness and durability. stitching, and fabrics. What happens when a retail genius and her amazingly talented husband follow their retirement from the marine Corps with the purchase of a kitchen shop? Magic happens! In the spring of 2013, Johnny designed artful, whimsical and fun LOL towels all in one night. The next day they set out to find themselves a screen printing machine, taught themselves to make it go, and have since sold thousands of these cheerful little towels from their shop in Savannah, Georgia. Partnering with Primitives by Kathy, they are thrilled to take their production to a whole new level. Welcome to the world of LOL - made you smile! In 1997, Kathy made her first \"primitive candle box\" By hand, taking care into each detail from the sanded edges to the type of ribbon tied on the wire handles, each was a work of passion. As Primitives by Kathy grows, the company works to give back, starting with an Initial relationship with goodwill services and expanding into several more charitable causes held both by the company and those the company supports on behalf of their employees. Look for all of Primitives by Kathy for inspirational, fun, sarcastic, and heart-warming gifts and home decor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Gxc3mDUkL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Primitives by Kathy","source_asin":"B00U0HEPFE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-508881","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00U0HEPFE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00U0HEPFE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
