window.products.push({"id":508930,"name":"Pasta Maker,Stainless Steel Manual Pasta Maker Machine With 8 Adjustable Thickness Settings,2 Blades Noodle Cutter, Perfect for Homemade Spaghetti, Fe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":40.21,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KZ2usr1dS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Quickly Creating Delicious Pasta : The manual pasta machine is easier than the traditional way of making pasta. Turn the crank arm by hand to roll the dough, which not only saves effort, but also saves your time. It is very suitable for making all kinds of fresh and delicious pasta. You can get that perfect flavor and texture, enjoy delicious pasta meals at home. Food-Grade Materials Pasta Machine: The pasta machine is made of food-grade 430 stainless steel, corrosion-resistant and not easy to rust. Aluminum alloy roller and cutter, durable construction. Comes with a base fixed clamp, ABS no-slip handle. Our sturdy and durable pasta machine will be a wonderful tool for your home kitchen. 8 Kinds of Thickness Adjustable Kit: 8 kinds of dough thickness settings, whether you like fresh tagliatelle, ravioli, fettuccine, linguine, vermicelli, This pasta maker can meet your requirements. It can knead the noodle dough into the perfect and delicious pasta! Pasta Roller with 2 Stainless Steel Blades: 2.0 mm (vermicelli); 4 mm (fettuccine), you can select the different thickness and width of your pasta, to create different pasta dishes that meet your needs. It is very easy to assemble, the workbench clamp and handle are easy to use, saving space and easy to store. 100% Satisfactory Service: We are very confident in our high-quality pasta maker . If you have any questions about our products, please feel free to contact us, we will bring you a perfect after-sales guarantee .Note: If the noodles are sticky and cannot shaped, please continue to add flour kneading and rolling.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KZ2usr1dS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Playoos","source_asin":"B08H1YCT2N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-508930","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H1YCT2N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H1YCT2N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
